  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You elemental nature allows you to literally walk on air.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Airy Step<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain a +4 bonus on saving throws against effects with the air or electricity descriptors and effects that deal electricity damage. You may ignore the first 30 feet of any fall when determining falling damage. Alternately, you may spend one use of your mythic power, as an immediate action when falling, to air walk for 1 round.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
